Subject: [PATCH] ia64/xen: Remove Xen support for ia64
Date: Thu,  5 Dec 2013 13:47:27 -0500
Message-Id: <1386269247-32401-1-git-send-email-boris.ostrovsky@oracle.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.8.1.4
X-Source-IP: ucsinet21.oracle.com [156.151.31.93]
Sender: linux-kernel-owner@vger.kernel.org
List-ID: <linux-kernel.vger.kernel.org>
X-Mailing-List: linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org

ia64 has not been supported by Xen since 4.2 so it's time to drop
Xen/ia64 from Linux as well.

Signed-off-by: Boris Ostrovsky <boris.ostrovsky@oracle.com>
---

This is only compile-tested.

There are also arch/ia64/kernel/paravirt* files that may be Xen-specific
but I wasn't sure so I left them in.

-boris


